<title>SRI LANKA: Bogala posts 9-month profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Bogala posts 9-month profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Bogala Graphite Lanka Ltd for the nine months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				 1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		120.14   vs     77.76</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)    17.59   vs   (41.43)</p>
<p>NOTE - Bogala Graphite Lanka which mines graphite for export turned in profits on improved labour relations and marketing, company officials said.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
